    // Before TUI, need to handle vroot outside check? That happens after TUI starts? Or before tty check?
    // Earlier test: `["/tmp", "--vroot", "/tmp/xplr_test_dir", "--on-load", "PrintPwdAndQuit"]` without tty gave vroot error or tty error?
    // We tested with tmux (with tty) and got vroot error. Without tty (via subprocess), what would it give? Need to test: run without tty (subprocess) with vroot outside.
